2026-10-24T04:12:23.6775225Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6775464Z 
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6775561Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6775713Z 
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6775785Z Commands:
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6776044Z   diagnostics         Export bounded private diagnostics without changing or stopping USB devices
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6776365Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6776661Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6777099Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6777716Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6778346Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6778829Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6779196Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6779552Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6779919Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6780315Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6780706Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6781078Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6781642Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6781974Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6782325Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6782646Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6782943Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6783210Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6783470Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6783710Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6783927Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6784079Z 
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6784126Z Options:
2026-10-24T04:12:23.6784309Z       --json                           Emit machine-readable JSON to stdout; logs remain on stderr
